# Release the extension > The gate
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/release-the-extension.md#L78
# 32b3cda0b610d6636b3bbd17b9ddce57b43ec80b

whole::a Take a version through the release ::e
gate::a Approve the release environment ::e --::P--> whole
publish::a Publish to the marketplaces ::e --::P--> whole
gate --> publish

rev::a Release reviewer ::t --> gate
wf::a release workflow ::t --> publish
draft::a the draft release ::t --> gate, publish
sums::a SHA256SUMS ::t --> gate
approval::a the required review ::t --> gate

rev --> Reviewer ::c
wf --> CI check ::c
draft --> output ::c
sums --> output ::c
approval --> gated approval ::c
